    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyw’ĩ aũme ma Athene, maũndũnĩ onthe nĩona kana mwĩ na maũndũ ma ũthaithi mwingĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ ngĩvĩtĩla nzĩanĩ, na ngĩsisya mũno syĩndũ sya ũthaithi wenyu, nonie kĩthembeo nakyo kĩkĩĩtwe ũandĩko ũũ, KWA NGAI ŨLA ŨTESĨKĨWE. Ũla inyw’ĩ ĩndĩ mũthaithaa kwa ũlea ũmanya, nĩwe ngũmwon’ya inyw’ĩ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
