          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namo meew’a ũvoo wa ũthayũũkyo wa akw’ũ, amwe moovũĩa ngũĩ; ĩndĩ angĩ masya, Tũkakwĩthukĩĩsya ĩngĩ ũvoonĩ ũũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kũilyĩ ũu Vaulo auma vo amatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ amwe malũman’ya nake, na meetĩkĩla: na amwe ma asu nĩ Ndionisio ũla Mũaleovako, na mũndũ mũka wetawa Ndamali, na angĩ vamwe nao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.17.34"
            ]
          }
        }
